sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py L106–L150" ;
        dcterms:description "SHA-256 registry for 5 dataset files (Pass 3 adds suture_fracture_ballistic_reference.json and re-pins the bib) with fail-closed runtime verification" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py#L106-L150> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/paper_citations.bib L47–L92" ;
        dcterms:description "Four new BibTeX entries with DOIs and 'DOI unverified offline' notes" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/paper_citations.bib#L47-L92> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — Source and data traceability: 86/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Five dataset files are SHA-256-pinned and verified fail-closed at runtime (`EXPECTED_SHA256` L106-127, `verify_dataset_integrity` L137-150), including the new `suture_fracture_ballistic_reference.json` whose every constant carries a `provenance` flag (source / derived / model) and an explicit honesty note (JSON L9), and `paper_citations.bib` gains Freund 1990, Hofhuis 2016, Swaine & Beer 1977 and Vogel 2005 with the offline-unverified status recorded in each `note` (bib L47-92). Deductions: 12 of the Pass 3 constants are `provenance: model` (rho, Gamma_c, CV_Gamma, a_0, tau_dry, n_seeds, m_seed, r_seed, C_d, eta, angle, height; JSON L29, L37-39, L41, L44-50) and Y = 420 MPa is inherited from the Pass 2 JSON default with no table citation (JSON L27) (-5); the four new DOIs could not be verified offline (-3); the bilayer formula's \"p. 1726-1727\" attribution and the w_tilde_c formula's \"Eq. 3 & SOM\" attribution are unverified, and the Pass 2 calibration Delta_eps = 0.0266 (L161, L1789) is chosen so that 1.5 * 0.0266 / 0.095 = 0.42 exactly (-3); Forterre 2005 is cited in the header (L19-22) and bib but used in no computation (-2); the SHA-pinned reference JSON still shows the un-normalised energy density (JSON L33) while the code uses the w_tilde_c-normalised form (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/source-traceability" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py L160–L173: compute_sclerenchyma_bilayer_kappa0 default Delta_eps = 0.0266 reproduces kappa_0 = 0.42 exactly; attribution of the 3/2 bilayer formula unverified <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py#L160-L173>",
            "datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json L70–L123: 4-system table with page/figure pointers only; no digitisation coordinates for Erythrina or latex R_obs/P_obs <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json#L70-L123>",
            "datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/suture_fracture_ballistic_reference.json L9–L52: Honesty note and per-constant provenance flags; 12 constants are provenance: model, Y = 420 MPa inherits an uncited Pass 2 default <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/suture_fracture_ballistic_reference.json#L9-L52>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability-2> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.86"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 065 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

